{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不少做過「通波仔」的病友都會有一個疑問：術後做運動會否加重心臟負擔？在《流行都市》節目中，註冊物理治療師陳效民為大家詳細講解心臟復康計劃，教大家如何安全地透過運動強健心肺。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">病友在術後其實非常需要參與心臟復康計劃。研究顯示，若患者臥床大約3天，心肺功能和肌力便會迅速下降；若臥床達10天，肌肉量更可流失達1公斤，影響甚大。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">針對有運動習慣的病友（如行山、踩單車或急步行等），可按個人興趣循序漸進地恢復訓練；若本身沒有運動習慣，則可依據心臟復康指引，由淺入深地進行相應的肌力及心肺訓練。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"cf69fa3a-7524-41a9-83de-90b46cb0bc7f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026RAvapVuOWG1787736495.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cf69fa3a-7524-41a9-83de-90b46cb0bc7f.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在運動過程中，病友必須密切留意身體狀況：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為確保安全，病友應緊記以下三大守則。此外，家屬亦應在身心靈上給予陪伴與鼓勵，切忌過分保護，應讓病友在安全情況及專業指導下多作嘗試。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">心臟復康運動包含熱身、主運動及緩和三個階段，過程中需時刻察覺是否有危險指數或症狀出現。</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"6e1b2884-137f-41de-a266-f12b18473b00.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026BHJVazjRsS1787736494.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6e1b2884-137f-41de-a266-f12b18473b00.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"24098f75-062e-479f-a3fe-0b904270f5ed.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026rwWba31gsP1787736494.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"24098f75-062e-479f-a3fe-0b904270f5ed.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"e461c070-1deb-40ec-b1c5-197d1f6e6d60.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ZUrE1JXBBf1787736494.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e461c070-1deb-40ec-b1c5-197d1f6e6d60.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"e1cac3f3-74f3-466e-bd19-aca9c2d8c074.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20262B21YAiJDt1787736494.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e1cac3f3-74f3-466e-bd19-aca9c2d8c074.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">**本節目內主持及嘉賓的言論純屬個人意見並不代表本台立場。此內容僅供參考。如需獲得醫療意見或診斷，請諮詢專業人士。</span><br/><br/><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">文章版權為無綫集團有限公司所擁有，原文請按﹕ </span><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://www.tvb.com/1015603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.tvb.com/1015603</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T13:39:46.344238+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":482,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}